  "narrative": {
    "intro": "M1 Support Services L P recorded $687M in federal contract obligations for FY2026 to date, across 15 awards with an average award size of $45.8M. Obligations are down 29.1% year over year for the same reporting window. Fiscal-year obligations show a multi-year pattern: FY21 was $831M, FY22 was $821M, FY23 was $849M, FY24 was $904M, FY25 was $969M, and FY26 is $687M. Other Support Activities for Air Transportation is the dominant market for M1 Support Services L P in FY2026 to date with $659M in obligations. Aircraft Manufacturing is a secondary market with $27.4M in obligations. The current-year totals are partial and represent fiscal year to date activity, and the largest markets reflect where obligations are concentrated this fiscal year.",
